    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782630/extras/173dc74042be36901a3012fad07dff35.avif?t=1749991114\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span>You're a genius with the ability to assemble, but you can't do anything in the big city. By chance, you pick up a flyer and find that a new mine has been excavated in a certain town, and if you join now, you will be given a house and a car. You think it's a great time to show what you're capable of. So I went to a certain town.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated terrain allows players to freely dig through the map\uff1b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports single-player play, and the official version will support multiplayer mode\uff1b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain wealth and experience by mining ores, and the wealth obtained can be invested in the town's buildings to revitalize the town's development, or you can buy high-level blueprints to build more advanced excavators\uff1b</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782630/extras/173dc74042be36901a3012fad07dff35.avif?t=1749991114\" data-has-big width=800 height=258 /></span>You're a genius with the ability to assemble, but you can't do anything in the big city. By chance, you pick up a flyer and find that a new mine has been excavated in a certain town, and if you join now, you will be given a house and a car. You think it's a great time to show what you're capable of. So I went to a certain town.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated terrain allows players to freely dig through the map\uff1b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports single-player play, and the official version will support multiplayer mode\uff1b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain wealth and experience by mining ores, and the wealth obtained can be invested in the town's buildings to revitalize the town's development, or you can buy high-level blueprints to build more advanced excavators\uff1b</p></li></ul>",
